sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant TUI
    participant Runtime
    participant ReActAgent
    participant LLM
    participant Tools

    User->>TUI: Tra hồ sơ SV 22520001 và lịch học hôm nay
    TUI->>Runtime: Submit message
    Runtime->>ReActAgent: Run(conversation, toolset)

    ReActAgent->>LLM: Round 1: think with full task
    LLM-->>ReActAgent: Need student profile tool
    ReActAgent->>Tools: load_mcp_tool(get_student_profile)
    Tools-->>ReActAgent: Tool loaded

    ReActAgent->>LLM: Round 2: think again with history
    LLM-->>ReActAgent: Call get_student_profile
    ReActAgent->>Tools: get_student_profile(student_id)
    Tools-->>ReActAgent: Profile observation

    ReActAgent->>LLM: Round 3: think again with profile
    LLM-->>ReActAgent: Need schedule tool
    ReActAgent->>Tools: load_mcp_tool(get_today_schedule)
    Tools-->>ReActAgent: Tool loaded

    ReActAgent->>LLM: Round 4: think again with history
    LLM-->>ReActAgent: Call get_today_schedule
    ReActAgent->>Tools: get_today_schedule(student_id)
    Tools-->>ReActAgent: Schedule observation

    ReActAgent->>LLM: Round 5: synthesize final answer
    LLM-->>ReActAgent: Final answer
    ReActAgent-->>Runtime: Completed(answer, stats)
    Runtime-->>TUI: Stream answer and stats
    TUI-->>User: Show final answer
